  "description": {
    "raw": "You channel positive energy to cure 1d8 points of damage + 1 point per caster level (maximum +25) on each selected creature. Like other cure spells, mass cure light wounds deals damage to undead in its area rather than curing them. Each affected undead may attempt a Will save for half damage.",
    "search_text": "Cure Light Wounds, Mass targets one selected creature per caster level within close range, with no two targets more than 30 feet apart. It cures each living target for 1d8 plus 1 per caster level, maximum +25, and damages undead; each affected undead can attempt a Will save for half damage.",
    "sections": [
